{"seq":1,"slug":"embedded-systems-programming","title":"嵌入式系统编程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/electrical-control-systems/embedded-systems-programming","wordCount":1483,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"嵌入式系统编程\">嵌入式系统编程</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><h3 id=\"机器人嵌入式系统架构\">机器人嵌入式系统架构</h3><p>机器人嵌入式系统是连接感知、决策与执行的硬件计算平台。与通用计算机不同，嵌入式系统强调实时性、确定性和资源约束下的高效运行。一个典型的机器人嵌入式架构采用分层设计：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;上位机(ROS2/Linux)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;EtherCAT / CAN&quot;| B[&quot;主控制器(STM32H7)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;SPI/I2C&quot;| C[&quot;传感器接口&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;PWM/通信&quot;| D[&quot;电机驱动器&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;UART&quot;| E[&quot;IMU模块&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;编码器&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;力矩传感器&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;BLDC电机&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"上位机(ROS2/Linux)\"] --&gt;|\"EtherCAT / CAN\"| B[\"主控制器(STM32H7)\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"SPI/I2C\"| C[\"传感器接口\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"PWM/通信\"| D[\"电机驱动器\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"UART\"| E[\"IMU模块\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"编码器\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"力矩传感器\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"BLDC电机\"]</pre><h3 id=\"常用嵌入式平台\">常用嵌入式平台</h3><p><strong>STM32 系列</strong>是机器人关节控制器的主力平台：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>STM32F4：Cortex-M4 内核，168MHz，适合中等复杂度控制</li>\n<li>STM32H7：Cortex-M7 内核，480MHz，双精度浮点，支持复杂算法</li>\n<li>STM32G4：专为电机控制优化，集成高速ADC和比较器</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>ESP32</strong>系列适合低成本物联网机器人：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>双核 240MHz，集成 Wi-Fi/BLE</li>\n<li>丰富外设但实时性不如 STM32</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>FPGA</strong>用于需要极低延迟的场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>并行处理能力，时钟级确定性延迟</li>\n<li>适合高频PWM生成、编码器接口、视觉预处理</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"实时操作系统-rtos\">实时操作系统（RTOS）</h3><p>裸机编程（Bare-metal）适合简单控制回路，但多任务场景下需要 RTOS 保证时间确定性。</p>\n<p><strong>FreeRTOS</strong> 是机器人领域最广泛使用的 RTOS：</p>\n<p>任务创建示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"void vMotorControlTask(void *pvParameters) {&#10;    TickType_t xLastWakeTime = xTaskGetTickCount();&#10;    const TickType_t xPeriod = pdMS_TO_TICKS(1); // 1ms周期&#10;&#10;    for(;;) {&#10;        readEncoder();&#10;        computePID();&#10;        setMotorPWM();&#10;        vTaskDelayUntil(&amp;xLastWakeTime, xPeriod);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> vMotorControlTask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pvParameters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    TickType_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xLastWakeTime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xTaskGetTickCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TickType_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xPeriod </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pdMS_TO_TICKS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 1ms周期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(;;) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        readEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        computePID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        setMotorPWM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        vTaskDelayUntil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">xLastWakeTime, xPeriod);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>RTOS 任务调度的核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>优先级抢占</strong>：高优先级任务可中断低优先级任务</li>\n<li><strong>时间片轮转</strong>：同优先级任务共享CPU时间</li>\n<li><strong>优先级反转</strong>：低优先级任务持有高优先级任务需要的资源</li>\n<li><strong>优先级继承</strong>：解决优先级反转的机制</li>\n</ul>\n<p>典型任务优先级分配：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>电机控制</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>kHz</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>传感器采集</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext>Hz</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>通信</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>100</mn><mtext>Hz</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>状态监控</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext>Hz</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{电机控制}(1\\text{kHz}) &gt; \\text{传感器采集}(500\\text{Hz}) &gt; \\text{通信}(100\\text{Hz}) &gt; \\text{状态监控}(10\\text{Hz})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">电机控制</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kHz</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">传感器采集</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hz</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通信</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hz</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">状态监控</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hz</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"中断管理\">中断管理</h3><p>中断是实现实时响应的核心机制。STM32的嵌套向量中断控制器（NVIC）支持最多256级中断优先级。</p>\n<p>关键设计原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>中断服务程序（ISR）尽量短</strong>：仅做数据搬运，计算放在任务中</li>\n<li><strong>使用 DMA</strong>：传感器数据批量搬运不占CPU</li>\n<li><strong>避免在 ISR 中调用浮点运算</strong>：保存/恢复 FPU 上下文开销大</li>\n</ul>\n<p>中断延迟的组成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>latency</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>recognition</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>context_save</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>vector_fetch</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>ISR_entry</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{latency}} = t_{\\text{recognition}} + t_{\\text{context\\_save}} + t_{\\text{vector\\_fetch}} + t_{\\text{ISR\\_entry}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">latency</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recognition</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">context_save</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vector_fetch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ISR_entry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于 STM32H7，典型中断响应延迟约为 12 个时钟周期（约 25ns @480MHz）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"工业通信协议\">工业通信协议</h3><p><strong>CAN 总线</strong>（Controller Area Network）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>差分信号，抗干扰能力强</li>\n<li>多主站架构，支持优先级仲裁</li>\n<li>经典CAN速率：1Mbps，CAN FD：8Mbps</li>\n<li>适合关节间通信（报文短、实时性要求高）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>EtherCAT</strong>（Ethernet for Control Automation Technology）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于以太网物理层，速率100Mbps</li>\n<li>主从架构，&quot;飞读飞写&quot;极低延迟（&lt; 1<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>s）</li>\n<li>分布式时钟同步精度 &lt; 100ns</li>\n<li>适合多轴伺服系统的实时同步控制</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>SPI/I2C</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用于板内芯片间通信</li>\n<li>SPI 高速（数十MHz），全双工</li>\n<li>I2C 低速（400kHz~3.4MHz），仅需2线</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"电机控制底层实现\">电机控制底层实现</h3><p>BLDC 电机的 FOC（Field-Oriented Control，磁场定向控制）是现代伺服控制的基础：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Clark 变换</strong>：三相 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(i_a, i_b, i_c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> → 两相 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(i_\\alpha, i_\\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span clas