s=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为电角度，通常由编码器测量机械角度后乘以极对数获得。</p>\n<h3 id=\"安全与看门狗机制\">安全与看门狗机制</h3><p>机器人嵌入式系统必须具备故障安全机制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>硬件看门狗</strong>：MCU异常时自动复位</li>\n<li><strong>心跳监测</strong>：主控与关节控制器定期通信确认</li>\n<li><strong>过流保护</strong>：硬件比较器+软件双重保护</li>\n<li><strong>急停电路</strong>：独立于软件的硬件切断回路</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2025-2026年，机器人嵌入式系统正向更高集成度和更强算力方向演进。RISC-V 架构开始在机器人控制器中崭露头角——其开源特性允许定制指令集（如向量运算扩展），特别适合电机控制中的定点DSP运算。</p>\n<p>此外，TSN（Time-Sensitive Networking）正在替代传统工业总线，实现千兆以太网级别的确定性通信。ROS2 与 TSN 的结合使得&quot;上位机实时控制&quot;成为可能，模糊了传统上下位机的边界。</p>\n<p>基于 Rust 语言的嵌入式开发也在机器人社区中快速普及。Rust 的所有权系统在编译期消除了内存安全问题，对于安全关键的机器人系统具有重要价值。Embassy 框架已支持 STM32 全系列的异步嵌入式开发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计一个机器人关节控制器的 FreeRTOS 任务架构：包含电机FOC控制（10kHz）、位置环（1kHz）、CAN通信（1kHz）和温度监控（1Hz）四个任务，确定优先级分配和CPU利用率。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>如果 CAN 总线上同时有3个关节发送状态报文（ID分别为 0x101, 0x102, 0x103），描述 CAN 仲裁过程，哪个报文先发送？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>计算一个 EtherCAT 主站控制6个伺服关节时的通信周期。每个从站需要收发12字节数据，帧间隙为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.96</mn><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.96\\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.96</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么 FOC 控制中需要将三相电流变换到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dq</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 旋转坐标系，直接在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">abc</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 坐标系中做 PI 控制有什么问题？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>嵌入式系统编程是将控制算法&quot;落地&quot;为可靠硬件系统的关键环节。从 MCU 选型、RTOS 调度到工业通信和电机控制底层实现，每个环节都直接影响机器人的实时性能和运行可靠性。掌握硬件抽象与实时编程思维，是从&quot;算法仿真&quot;走向&quot;系统交付&quot;的必经之路。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"嵌入式系统编程","id":"嵌入式系统编程"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"机器人嵌入式系统架构","id":"机器人嵌入式系统架构"},{"level":3,"text":"常用嵌入式平台","id":"常用嵌入式平台"},{"level":3,"text":"实时操作系统（RTOS）","id":"实时操作系统-rtos"},{"level":3,"text":"中断管理","id":"中断管理"},{"level":3,"text":"工业通信协议","id":"工业通信协议"},{"level":3,"text":"电机控制底层实现","id":"电机控制底层实现"},{"level":3,"text":"安全与看门狗机制","id":"安全与看门狗机制"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"结构设计与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/mechanical-design-fundamentals/structural-design-optimization"},"next":{"title":"传感器与信号处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/electrical-control-systems/sensors-and-signal-processing"}}